    "created_at": "2025-10-25T15:35:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-10-25T15:35:42Z",
    "body": "Yes, the correct solution to this is Cascade Layers, either used directly in your stylesheet (you can easily wrap an entire sheet in a `@layer` rule; no need to edit each individual property), or via the link attribute that @myakura mentions.\n\nSpeaking as a CSSWG member, the CSSWG would absolutely shoot down anything which makes it easier to misuse the `!important` feature.",
